  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported three buckling-factor/mode-displacement queries and synchronous/asynchronous member steel-utilization queries with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Corrected the factor by-reference output and preserved all six displacement components in a named immutable result. Added detached node identity/coordinate metadata, strict native success and written finite Double validation, documented design sentinels and same-thread settled Task behavior. Retained current-binding/lifetime/reentrancy guards and original native failures. See the buckling and steel-design guides for contracts and qualification limits.",
